#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:5 9c68fe253bd143ab8a70eb7d3352b13f
msgid "License (GPLv3)"
msgstr "许可证（GPLv3）"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:7 863d8acf9f274d92bb9daf389313a87c
msgid ""
"ArduPilot (including Copter, Plane, Rover, Sub and AntennaTracker) and the "
"ground control software (including Mission Planner, APM Planner2 and "
"MAVProxy) are free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under "
"the terms of the GNU General Public License version 3 as published by the "
"`Free Software Foundation <http://www.fsf.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot（包括 Copter、Plane、Rover、Sub 和 AntennaTracker）及地面站软件（包括 Mission "
"Planner、APM Planner2 和 MAVProxy）都是自由软件：你可以依照 `自由软件基金会 "
"<http://www.fsf.org/>`__ 发布的 GNU 通用公共许可证第 3 版的条款对其进行再分发和/或修改。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:9 2ac056955f934646adbdfcf24fb6d2ad
msgid ""
