"ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or "
"FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for "
"more details."
msgstr "该程序的发布是希望它有用，但不提供任何担保；甚至不提供对适销性或特定用途适用性的隐含担保。详见 GNU 通用公共许可证。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:14 51b20aff38004b9489a2afb09ce0d969
msgid ""
"For more specific details see `http://www.gnu.org/licenses, "
"<http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>`__ the `Quick Guide to GPLv3. "
"<http://www.gnu.org/licenses/quick-guide-gplv3.html>`__ and the `copying.txt"
" <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/COPYING.txt>`__ in the "
