"faq.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:23 c0ac9060842a4c16884ff3fc9f9ef667
msgid "Note to developers"
msgstr "开发者须知"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:25 43fd64cd71154f369dcb81c943d6abfd
msgid ""
"We very much appreciate you using our code to do fun and interesting things."
" We hope that while doing this you may find and fix bugs or make "
"enhancements that could be useful for the greater community and will make "
"the developers aware of them by creating an issue in the `issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ and/or :ref:`contribute a"
" fix using a pull request <submitting-patches-back-to-master>` so they can "
"be considered to be added to the original code base."
msgstr ""
"非常感谢你用我们的代码做有趣的事情。希望你在此过程中发现并修复 bug 或做出对更大社区有用的改进时，能在 `issues 列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ 创建 issue 让开发者知晓，和/或 "
":ref:`通过 pull request 贡献修复 <submitting-patches-back-to-master>`，供考虑并入原始代码库。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:32 4033021d2f344d7dbdb271f4d81d2753
msgid "Note to  businesses or individuals including this software in products"
msgstr "对将本软件集成到产品中的企业或个人的说明"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:34 467690c556d547a0b06c069f2d8179ce
msgid ""
"Firstly, by the very nature of the ArduPilot Project you are free to use all"
" of the code and tools provided in our Github repository under the terms of "
"the licenses without any authorization or involvement from our team. We "
"greatly appreciate those companies and individuals who incorporate this "
"software into their products for sale.  A significant number have already "
"done this.  There are some things that the license requires however that we "
"need to point out:"
msgstr ""
"首先，根据 ArduPilot 项目的性质，你可以在许可证条款下自由使用我们 Github "
"仓库中提供的所有代码和工具，无需经过我们团队的授权或介入。我们非常感谢将本软件集成到产品中销售的企业和个人，已有相当数量的企业和个人这样做了。但许可证有一些要求，我们需要特别指出："

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:37 37e0a3d104b0442ea9769e6bfaf64b24
msgid ""
"Inform your customers that the software is open source and provide the "
"actual source code in the product or provide a link to where the source code"
" can be found (see sample below)."
msgstr "告知你的客户该软件是开源的，并在产品中提供实际的源代码，或提供可找到源代码的链接（见下方示例）。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:43 e2c11bd399644e8baa3246099633f526
msgid ""
"As with the contributions of individual developers, we would like it if you "
"could keep us informed of the products that incorporate the software by "
"emailing partners@ardupilot.org.  Also for those changes that could be "
"useful to the wider community we would appreciate it if you could "
":ref:`contribute them back using a pull request <submitting-patches-back-to-"
"master>` for consideration to be added to the original code base."
msgstr ""
"与个人开发者的贡献一样，如果你能将采用了本软件的产品告知我们（发邮件到 "
"partners@ardupilot.org），我们将非常感谢。另外，对于可能对更广泛社区有用的修改，希望你能 :ref:`通过 pull "
"request 贡献回来 <submitting-patches-back-to-master>`，供考虑并入原始代码库。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:50 bcf1f060c03c4acbb079ea86fde11b09
msgid ""
"To both individual developers and companies we also ask that when making "
"derivative works, the original credits listing all the individuals that "
"contributed to getting the software to its current form are left in place."
msgstr "无论是个人开发者还是企业，我们都请求在制作衍生作品时，保留原始致谢列表，其中列出了所有为软件发展到当前版本做出贡献的人员。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:56 fa6233c3707d4e5faedd41cd4df93ed6
msgid "Why did we pick this license over others?"
msgstr "我们为何选择这个许可证而非其他许可证？"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:58 3869ed396349461d82c600ec82cffe02
msgid ""
"the requirement to contribute back bug fixes and enhancements to the project"
" (or at least provide those fixes to the end customer) increases cooperation"
" amongst the contributors.  Without this requirement participants are "
"tempted to keep even small improvements to themselves in order to gain an "
"advantage over other contributors.  There is evidence that this quickly "
"leads to many incompatible forks of the project to the detriment of all."
msgstr ""
"要求将 bug "
"修复和改进贡献回项目（或至少将修复提供给最终用户）的规定，可以增进贡献者之间的协作。若没有此要求，参与者会倾向于将哪怕细小的改进据为己有，以此在其他贡献者中获得竞争优势。有证据表明，这很快就会导致项目产生大量不兼容的分支，对所有人都有害。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:60 4d260bffbf184d7f8ea89c91846cde66
msgid "Linus Torvalds (inventor of Linux) agrees."
msgstr "Linux 的发明者 Linus Torvalds 也赞同这一观点。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:66 beee047b1cf04e5380df2d2a9baed86d
msgid ""
"the \"v3\" portion of the license ensures that the customer who purchased "
"the vehicle has the right to upgrade or replace the version of ArduPilot on "
"the flight controller.  The license doesn't require that it actually work "
"but just that the upgrade is possible.  This ensures that even if a "
"manufacturer stops supporting the product (which can happen for very valid "
"reasons) the product can continue to be useful if the owner or a community "
"of developers decides to pick up support.  Examples of this have already "
"happened with ArduPilot.  Note that this requirement only applies to `\"User"
" Products\" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/COPYING.txt#L297>`__ and"
" products where it is technically possible for the manufacturer to upgrade "
"the firmware on the device."
msgstr ""
"许可证的 \"v3\" 部分确保购买载具的客户有权升级或替换飞控上的 ArduPilot "
"版本。许可证并不要求升级后一定能正常工作，只要求升级是可能的。这保证了即使制造商停止支持产品（这可能有非常正当的理由），只要所有者或开发者社区愿意接手维护，产品仍能继续发挥作用。ArduPilot"
" 已经有过这样的实例。注意此要求只适用于 `\"User Products\" "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/COPYING.txt#L297>`__ "
"以及制造商在技术上可以升级设备固件的产品。"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:69 a6e162999d984403bfb20761b82ae8ad
msgid "Can I integrate Closed source (i.e. Proprietary) and Open Source?"
msgstr "我可以将闭源（专有）代码与开源代码集成吗？"

#: ../../source/docs/license-gplv3.rst:71 3b5c3a446969487b8c71ddda70dbf4e3
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is open source (GPLv3) but you can use a companion computer to run"
" closed source code to ease integrating ArduPilot into your corporate "
"systems or to add higher level features to differentiate yourself from your "
"rivals.  You build on the reliability of the free low-level flight code so "
"you can instead invest in the higher level features.  We believe ArduPilot "
"is as reliable as the leading closed system and you are not beholden to a "
"particular manufacturer.  Below is an image of how one manufacturer "
"accomplished this."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 是开源软件（GPLv3），但你可以使用伴飞计算机运行闭源代码，以便将 ArduPilot "
"集成到企业系统中或添加更高层次的特性以区别于竞争对手。你可以在免费的低层飞行代码的可靠性基础上构建，从而将精力投入到更高层次的特性开发中。我们相信 "
"ArduPilot 与领先的闭源系统同样可靠，且你不必依附于特定制造商。下图展示了某制造商实现这一目标的方案。"
